Wait — `ensureSession` is called by the session plugin on app:mounted. So app.vue doesn't need it. Just `user`, `signout`.

Header right:
```vue
<template #right>
  <nav class="flex items-center gap-1">
    <UButton to="/sell" label="Sell" color="neutral" variant="ghost" />
    <UButton to="/pay" label="Pay" color="neutral" variant="ghost" />
